<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Order Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Arial", sans-serif;
        background-color: #f5f7fa;
        color: #333;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 30px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      h2 {
        color: #2c3e50;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .order-info {
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        padding-top: 15px;
      }
      .order-info p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
      .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2b7a78;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        background-color: #2b7a78;
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>🎉 Order Confirmation</h2>
      <p>Hi there,</p>
      <p>
        Thank you for your purchase! Your order has been successfully created.
        Below are your order details:
      </p>

      <div class="order-info">
        <p><span class="highlight">Order ID:</span> <%= order._id %></p>
        <p><span class="highlight">Course Name:</span> <%= order.name %></p>
        <p><span class="highlight">Price:</span> $<%= order.price %></p>
        <p><span class="highlight">Date:</span> <%= order.date %></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        You can now access your course in your dashboard. If you have any
        questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.
      </p>

      <div style="text-align: center">
        <a href="https://yourwebsite.com/dashboard" class="btn"
          >Go to Dashboard</a
        >
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Your Company Name. All rights
          reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
